# Records assets/demo.gif. Needs graftui on PATH and vhs (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs): vhs assets/demo.tape

Output assets/demo.gif
Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1240
Set Height 720
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set Framerate 15

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "graftui --sandbox"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 4s

Down
Sleep 700ms
Down
Sleep 700ms
Down
Sleep 1.2s
Type "m"
Sleep 4.5s

Up
Sleep 500ms
Up
Sleep 500ms
Up
Sleep 1.2s
Type "m"
Sleep 5s

Down
Sleep 1.2s
Type "m"
Sleep 4.5s
Escape
Sleep 800ms
